/src/main/**/generated
# The Rust library is produced by `tauri android build` on every run.
# The bundled git executables next to it are NOT generated -- they come from
# scripts/android-git/build.sh and are committed, because CI builds from a
# clean checkout and an APK without them crashes on launch (git_bin::init
# fails, and the Tauri setup hook aborts the process).
/src/main/jniLibs/**/libgitty_lib.so
/src/main/assets/tauri.conf.json
/tauri.build.gradle.kts
/proguard-tauri.pro
/tauri.properties
